# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — LEDGERCHAT

## Project overview

Build a complete, modern, mobile-first financial management and business intelligence web application called **LedgerChat**.

Tagline: **Your conversations. Your business. One clear picture.**

LedgerChat is an AI-powered financial management platform designed for small businesses, informal merchants, WhatsApp vendors, retailers, wholesalers, fashion businesses, electronics dealers and independent service providers across Nigeria and Africa.

The platform transforms unstructured business conversations into organized financial records, transaction histories, customer insights, product analytics and business performance reports.

The target audience consists of ordinary business owners, many of whom have little or no accounting or technical knowledge.

The application must therefore be extremely intuitive. A person who understands WhatsApp and how to receive bank transfers should be able to navigate the application without needing technical training.

Do not build this as a generic admin dashboard. Build it as a polished, commercially credible financial product.

